            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3><span>Christmas Tea&nbsp;</span></h3>
<p>December 13, 14, 20 and 21 with seatings at 11:30 am and 2:30 pm&nbsp;<br>
Cost: $32.04 per person (taxes included)&nbsp;<br>
<strong>Reservations are required. The online reservation request form opens Wednesday, November 5 at 10 am</strong>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p>Celebrate the season with your friends and loved ones at Billings Estate National Historic Site. Share in the holiday spirit as you enjoy a seasonal three-tier tea service surrounded by our festive, 19<sup>th</sup> century-inspired, décor. Your tea service will include a pot of tea (coffee and hot chocolate are also available), finger sandwiches, a scone with butter and jam, and a selection of mini desserts. All menu items are prepared or baked in-house with fresh ingredients.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<h4>Reservations</h4>
<p>To request a reservation, <strong>submit the online request form beginning Wednesday, November 5 at 10 am. </strong>Thank you for your patience while we process the high volume of requests.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>By submitting an online reservation request, you are confirming that you have read and acknowledged the information provided below. </strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li><span>We anticipate that interest in this program will exceed capacity. Once reservations are full, a waitlist will be maintained.&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><span>Reservations are filled in the order requests are received. Submitting the request form does not mean your booking is confirmed. A staff person will follow up with you by email to review your request and to provide further details regarding online advance payment. If advance payment is not received by the indicated date, the reservation will be offered to the next group on the waitlist. Your reservation is not confirmed until advance payment has been received.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><span>The maximum reservation size is six.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><span>Guests are seated at tables of four or six. To ensure pathways remain clear, tables cannot be pushed together, and additional chairs cannot be added.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><span>Pairs or smaller groups will be seated at a shared table. We encourage guests to embrace the season and break the ice with new friends over a hot cup of tea.&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><span>We will inquire about any food allergies, dietary requirements (e.g., vegan or gluten-free, etc.) or accessibility needs when confirming your reservation. Before requesting a reservation, please review any individual needs with every member of your group. While we make all reasonable efforts to accommodate allergies and dietary restrictions identified during the reservation process, we cannot guarantee a cross-contact free environment. Regrettably, we cannot meet last-minute requests for accommodation at the time of service.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p>If you require assistance with the reservation process, please contact 613-580-2088 ext. 35258 or email <a href="mailto:BillingsEstateTea@ottawa.ca" target="_blank">BillingsEstateTea@ottawa.ca</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
